    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc98e50c914c5732d23a3a77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不愿放弃的梦想——此刻已化作强烈的祈愿。\r\n若是她继续如此祈愿的话，一定能有所回应——\r\n不。我想要主动回应她的祈愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75918899ab71594298beb2eada8ebe596b558014493de2c712ae6118248a8e4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
