      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23f99da84f85d1095a6126b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7aa39e4c586f4ac4c2b0490",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我……又弱小又不起眼……您可能会幻灭的哦……？\r\n真的……可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "643612d3dc57763bab653a0ffa03e4a434128b8027f430e9dcb4af8ba2615fdf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2b8b949717048ebdaa95a67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为回应她的祈愿，我点头表示肯定。『追寻英雄之旅』暂告一段落。\r\n——如今，我更想要读读这全新的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f1addcd5f7eb85e3edd5a94bdf61d8b7f17040852fc46f13d90723b0aece16d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a8aa3e4e602cd61164ac6bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b5a0068ef225d3d34857c21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以……我觉得……就算您特意来观战，\r\n也有可能压根就注意不到我……什么的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb8a525d01b3e2fb3388c6f24f1d58e93e193f7bf014ccea28dbd32c1056975b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a218ef668543af2d3a4cb2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不好意思……是我自作主张了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8c7a86acfdaaca346d66401e1cc01f2ab95d67659cfd289cc79629e7d7d3868",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7f21ff0552f38053b982a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
