      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69de349d04772183d544d33b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……既然您和教官小姐聊过了……那您也……知道了吧。\r\n最近的我真的……什么都做不好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "93cfb0e27dd0cc9bd39e16c538be14819aa63acad186d3b8d274b7b91594e67f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4abd8b7da884baa58640495e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaf6b29d17c0d17b31649773a41c9995f963b5bb8c45fb8d89c79c740e5bc158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1047/storytimeline_041047003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6a8d2fe110085e5f010a0a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有没有！请您不要介意，谢谢您愿意来观战。\r\n不过最近，确实是有点被逼至绝境的感觉了呢……哎嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc12fab34a606f3fe231c99b8137fa989f75fe7597de5f7f3e5ac2ce7336bbd3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
